  "description": "True wind direction that holds steady through tacks and gybes. The B&G H5000's calibration tables and damping in Signal K: boat speed, TWA and TWS tables, fitted from your logs by boatcal plugincal, edited and watched live in a webapp. Try it in shadow mode beside your instruments.",
